# Video AI pipeline — direct dependencies.
# These are the top-level packages that the pipeline imports directly.
# The full transitive lock is in requirements-video-ai.lock.
#
# Python 3.12 is required (whisperx/ctranslate2 incompatible with 3.13+).
#
# Install: pip install -r requirements-video-ai.lock
# Update:   pip-compile requirements-video-ai.in -o requirements-video-ai.lock

